This package contains the ECDT-R1 model developed in the MERGE workspace.
It is distinct from the original MERGE GAT baseline.

Original MERGE project:
https://github.com/ags3927/MERGE
The original MIT license is included in LICENSE.

The model consumes frozen 1024-dimensional Phikon-v2 image features.
Phikon-v2 encoder weights and datasets are not distributed in this source package.
https://huggingface.co/owkin/phikon-v2
